      <elementAttributes>
        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>Register mode(type of op=00)= 2bit (type of op)+2bit (op) + 2bit (Reg1) + 2bit (Reg2) + 10bit (Don&apos;t Care)
Immediate mode(Type of op=01)=2bit (type of op) + 2bit (op) + 2bit (Reg1) + 5bit (Imm  value) + 7bit (Don&apos;t Care)
Jump mode(Type of op=10)=2bit (type of op) + 2bit (op) + 4bit (Addr) + 10bit (Don&apos;t Care)
Add(Op=00), Shift Left(Op=01), OR(Op=10)
JMP(Op=00), JL(Op=01)

JL START		100100010000000000
START: ADD R0,R1	000000010000000000
JMPTO: ADD R0,5	010000001010000000
JMP JMPTO		100000100000000000</string>
        </entry>
      </elementAttributes>
